window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-030-cafe7795da9b6234.json"]={sha256:"cafe7795da9b6234e991f8cb8071f495a694d576603f5369b4866078981d4b94",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-b7c409273267b461","url":"https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core/blob/master/infiniband-diags/man/perfquery.8.in.rst","title":"perfquery source and manual","titleEn":"perfquery source and manual","publisher":"linux-rdma project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-030","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-030","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-031","referenceUrls":["https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/"],"title":"Lustre：檔案位移到 stripe 槽位的可逆映射","titleEn":"Lustre: reversible mapping from file offsets to stripe slots","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付 counter 字典、原始與標準化欄位、雙端重複計數反例以及完整時間窗；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the counter dictionary, raw and normalized values, a two-endpoint double-counting counterexample and complete timing scope. Retain enough metadata for another learner to audit every multiplier. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"生成 layout.json 與 offset.csv；保存 slot_to_ost 獨立查表，再輸出 stripe_index、slot、object_offset 三欄。","differenceEn":"Create layout.json and offset.csv, with a separate slot-to-OST lookup. Emit stripe index, slot and object-local offset as separate fields, preserving the full mapping rather than returning only a storage target name.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課指定 PortXmitData 增量乘四得到位元組，再除時間與 1000000 得 decimal MB/s；不套用到所有計數器；單埠增量 1000000 counter units，觀測時間由 2 改為 4 秒；計數器未重置且觀察方向固定；名義式 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s；變更式 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","固定條帶模型中，槽位為 floor(offset/stripe_size) 對 stripe_count 取餘；物件內位移另由完整輪數與條帶內餘數計算；檔案位移 6 MiB、四個槽位且槽位從零起算；stripe_size 由 1 改為 2 MiB，不含 PFL 或鏡像布局；名義式 floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot；變更式 floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For the specified PortXmitData counter, multiply increments by four, divide by elapsed seconds and then by one million for decimal MB/s. Do not apply that multiplier indiscriminately to every counter field. A single port increases by 1000000 counter units. Observation duration changes from 2 to 4 seconds, with no reset and unchanged transmit direction. This is a synthetic interval, not a fabric measurement. Nominal 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s; changed 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For a fixed-stripe teaching layout, slot is the stripe index modulo stripe count. Object-local offset additionally depends on complete rounds and the remainder within a stripe, so slot alone is not a complete address. Use file offset 6 MiB and four zero-based slots. Stripe size changes from 1 to 2 MiB. The fixture excludes progressive layouts, mirrors and vendor-specific object identifiers. Nominal floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot; changed floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-040","referenceUrls":["https://portal.hdfgroup.org/documentation/hdf5/latest/_s_w_m_r_t_n.html"],"title":"HDF5 SWMR：可見長度與應用發布邊界","titleEn":"HDF5 SWMR: visible extent and application publication boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付 counter 字典、原始與標準化欄位、雙端重複計數反例以及完整時間窗；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the counter dictionary, raw and normalized values, a two-endpoint double-counting counterexample and complete timing scope. Retain enough metadata for another learner to audit every multiplier. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 data_flush、reader_refresh、commit_marker 事件表；每筆記單調序號與觀察時間，消費者僅讀 [0,safe_count)。","differenceEn":"Build data-flush, reader-refresh and commit-marker events with monotonic sequence numbers and observation times. The consumer reads only [0,safe_count), retaining the three observed bounds separately.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課指定 PortXmitData 增量乘四得到位元組，再除時間與 1000000 得 decimal MB/s；不套用到所有計數器；單埠增量 1000000 counter units，觀測時間由 2 改為 4 秒；計數器未重置且觀察方向固定；名義式 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s；變更式 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","本課保守消費上限為已 flush 資料數、讀者可見 extent 與應用 committed_count 的最小值；這不是 HDF5 內建跨物件交易；資料已 flush 52 筆、讀者 extent 為 49；committed_count 名義 48、變更 50，其他狀態固定；名義式 min(min(52,49),48) = 48 records safe to consume；變更式 min(min(52,49),50) = 49 records safe to consume。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For the specified PortXmitData counter, multiply increments by four, divide by elapsed seconds and then by one million for decimal MB/s. Do not apply that multiplier indiscriminately to every counter field. A single port increases by 1000000 counter units. Observation duration changes from 2 to 4 seconds, with no reset and unchanged transmit direction. This is a synthetic interval, not a fabric measurement. Nominal 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s; changed 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","The teaching consumer limit is the minimum of flushed data count, reader-visible extent and application committed_count. This explicit application protocol is not an HDF5 built-in multi-object transaction guarantee. Data are flushed through 52 records and the reader-visible extent is 49. Application committed_count changes from 48 to 50 while the other observations remain fixed. Nominal min(min(52,49),48) = 48 records safe to consume; changed min(min(52,49),50) = 49 records safe to consume. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-856df3e3986f0a20","url":"https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/","title":"Lustre parallel filesystems","titleEn":"Lustre parallel filesystems","publisher":"LUMI consortium","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-e900590b2e7d319e","url":"https://portal.hdfgroup.org/documentation/hdf5/latest/_s_w_m_r_t_n.html","title":"Introduction to Single-Writer/Multiple-Reader","titleEn":"Introduction to Single-Writer/Multiple-Reader","publisher":"The HDF Group","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
